  "_note": [
    "Hand-curated hunt-priority tiers transcribed from RogueMaster's OT-dex",
    "completion guide. The forum guide itself uses a quirky 0,1,2,4,5,6",
    "numbering (skips T3); we renumber to consecutive 0..4 so the tracker UI",
    "reads cleanly. Mapping:",
    "  guide T0..T2 → ours T0..T2 (unchanged)",
    "  guide T4    → ours T3  (Normal Horde, default for unlisted mons)",
    "  guide T5    → ours T4  (Game Corner)",
    "",
    "Lower number = higher hunt priority. Mons NOT listed here default to",
    "tier 3 (normal common-horde encounter — use Horde guide + Pokedex Helper).",
    "Tier 6 in the guide (breeding/leveling cleanup) is a *strategy* rather",
    "than a specific list; not assigned here, since the existing tracker",
    "filters (Babies + Evolution method) cover that ground.",
    "",
    "Game Corner (T4) roster includes Eevee, Dratini line, Porygon line,",
    "Pinsir, and Scyther line per Celadon GC's actual prize list. When the",
    "GC head (Eevee, Dratini, Scyther) gets picked up here, we tag the full",
    "evo line in the same tier so the tracker surfaces the family together.",
    "",
    "Evolution-line scoping: when the guide names ONE mon (e.g. 'Audino') we",
    "also tag its evolution line in the same tier. The reason: the in-game",
    "Pokédex counts the family together, and tracker users want to see",
    "Drilbur next to Excadrill so they know which to hunt and which to breed",
    "down to / evolve up to."
  ],
